  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それじゃあ……みんな、行くぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "動画の音声"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……うおっ！　秋山のギター、凄いな！\n会場のみんなも大盛り上がりだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今のライブ映像は、私たちの公式チャンネル\n開設記念動画の中でも、特に話題沸騰中です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "演奏のテクニックもさることながら、\n隼人のキラキラした笑顔がグッと来るな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。この好きなものへの真っ直ぐさが、\nきっと、見ている人にも伝わってるんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それなら、この前あげた筋トレ動画の\n誠司さんも負けてないですね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "木村 龍"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分は言われた通り、\nいつものトレーニング風景を撮っただけなんだが……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "隼人に負けないくらい、キラキラの笑顔だったぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "握野 英雄"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 12,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そ、そうか。少々恥ずかしいな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_c:step-12:text",
